===

title: Skier2_Act2
---
Skier: Yo! Yo! Yo! What's up Brochacho!
Skier: Yo, listen. I, like, totally lost my phone!
Skier: I was filming a vid from the ski lift and I, like, totally dropped it!
Skier: Thing was, there was this one guy interuppting the vid too. Talking about, like, uprooting trees and draining the lake.
Skier: Or something! I dunno!
Skier: Anyways, if you find it I'm in your debt man! Totally! Totally! Totally! 
===

title: Skier2_Act3
---
Skier: Yo! Yo! Yo! What's up Dawg!
Skier: You found my phone! They did, like, a whole announcement and everything!
Skier: I totally owe you, consider us peas in the same pod!
Skier: Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!
===

title: Skier2_Act4
---
